=0$, where $a\\ne 0.$ Which of the following statements are true? \n\n- $a\\cdot a<0$\n- $b\\cdot a>0$\n- $b\\cdot a=5$" 13194139534964 true] [17592186323059 1113 #uuid "6c7267a9-814c-5af4-b1fd-9515f0fed3e3" 13194139534964 true] [17592186323059 1145 "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Indeed, $a\\ne 0$ implies that $a\\cdot a>0.$\n\n- Statement II and III are false. Simplifying the expression $a\\cdot (a+b)=0$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (a+b) & =0 \\\\ a\\cdot a+a\\cdot b & =0 \\\\ a\\cdot a+b\\cdot a & =0 \\\\ b\\cdot a & =-a\\cdot a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nSince $a\\ne 0$ implies that $a\\cdot a>0$, we obtain that $b\\cdot a<0.$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the correct answer is \"None of the statements are true\"." 13194139534964 true] [17592186323060 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323061 13194139534964 true] [17592186323060 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323062 13194139534964 true] [17592186323060 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323063 13194139534964 true] [17592186323060 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323064 13194139534964 true] [17592186323060 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323065 13194139534964 true] [17592186323060 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534964 true] [17592186323060 1041 "selection" 13194139534964 true] [17592186323060 1104 #edb/ref 17592186323061 13194139534964 true] [17592186323060 1110 #uuid "3b41db8b-1baa-5df8-9618-5b209121fe17" 13194139534964 true] [17592186323061 1034 "None of the statements are true" 13194139534964 true] [17592186323061 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534964 true] [17592186323061 1111 #uuid "98af5ec6-aa41-5b14-97b5-d2bd6125cd35" 13194139534964 true] [17592186323062 1034 "I, II, and III" 13194139534964 true] [17592186323062 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534964 true] [17592186323062 1111 #uuid "a760c7ea-d979-5c1e-a9ff-edaf88c632af" 13194139534964 true] [17592186323063 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534964 true] [17592186323063 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534964 true] [17592186323063 1111 #uuid "a4073eff